msgid "Current Document Folder"
msgstr "Biredäge İstälek Törgäge"

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:203
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can enter a path for a folder to display."
"<p>To go to a folder previously entered, press the arrow on the right and "
"choose one. "
"<p>The entry has folder completion. Right-click to choose how completion should "
"behave."
msgstr ""
"<p>Kürsätäse törgäk yulın bonda kertep bula."
"<p>Baya kertelgän törgäklär arasında saylaw öçen, uñdağı uqqa çirtäse. "
"<p>Bu keremdä törgäk tutılandıru bar. Tulılandırunı köyläw öçen uñ-çirtü "
"qullanası."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:208
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can enter a name filter to limit which files are displayed."
"<p>To clear the filter, toggle off the filter button to the left."
"<p>To reapply the last filter used, toggle on the filter button."
msgstr ""
"<p>Kürsätäse biremnär sözgeçen bonda kertep bula."
"<p>Ul sözgeçne buşatu öçen, suldağı töymäne sünderäse."
"<p>Baya qullanılğan sözgeçne kire açu öçen, ul töymäne açası."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:212
msgid ""
"<p>This button clears the name filter when toggled off, or reapplies the last "
"filter used when toggled on."
msgstr ""
"<p>Bu töymä sünek bulğanda sözgeç qullanılmí, açıq bulğanda isä baya kertelgän "
"sözgeç qullanıla."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:326
msgid "Apply last filter (\"%1\")"
msgstr "Soñğı sözgeçne aşır (\"%1\")"

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:331
msgid "Clear filter"
msgstr "Sözgeçne buşat"

